**Given:**

Repeating decimal 0.overline{3}

**Formula Used:**

To express a repeating decimal in the form (p)/(q)

**Calculation:**

Let x = 0.overline{3}

⇒ 10x = 3.overline{3}

⇒ 10x - x = 3.overline{3} - 0.overline{3}

⇒ 9x = 3

⇒ x = (3)/(9)

⇒ x = (1)/(3)

**The fraction form of 0.overline{3} is (1)/(3) .**
